          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a ranged attack is allocated to a model in that unit, add 1 to the saving throw made against that attack. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Resonance Stave: Melee weapons equipped by the bearer have the [Anti-Infantry 5+] and [Devastating Wounds] abilities.)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
